# Synthetic case 3 — T root + stubs + MST edges (TRUNK_H+MST).
# A source (left) + a row of receivers BELOW an H spine → a T/comb (root + V stubs).
# Two scattered one-off blocks (M1,M2) far bottom-right, close together → an MST edge
# (block-to-block) beats each reaching the trunk.  One bus, 8 bits.
def_layer 6 M6 H TOP 50
def_layer 7 M7 V TOP 50
def_layer 4 M4 H 50
def_layer 5 M5 V 50
add_block S 0 460 80 540
add_block R0 400 280 480 360
add_block R1 640 280 720 360
add_block R2 880 280 960 360
add_block R3 1120 280 1200 360
add_block M1 1450 820 1530 900
add_block M2 1600 880 1680 960
add_bus bus[8] S.p R0.p,R1.p,R2.p,R3.p,M1.p,M2.p
run_bundler
generate_topologies multi_trunk
run_planner
run_nuts
ripup_reroute
report_wirelength
visualize
